  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"6.1.2\"\n\npackage:\n  name: lcg-relax\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://lcgpackages.web.cern.ch/tarFiles/sources/RELAX-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: f91b81404c13da7d8ae92f2720f1b2ef0170116f16bc89a2bfd49179f7d33251\n  patches:\n    # GCCXML is no longer needed since ROOT 6.00 replaced it with Cling/rootcling\n    # See https://root.cern/root/html600/notes/release-notes.html\n    - patches/0001-remove-gccxml-dependency.patch\n    - patches/0002-use-shared-library-type.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  skip:\n    - win\n  script:\n    - |\n      cmake -B build -S ${SRC_DIR} ${CMAKE_ARGS} \\\n          -GNinja \\\n          -DCMAKE_CXX_STANDARD=$(root-config --cxxstandard)\n      cmake --build build --parallel ${CPU_COUNT}\n      cmake --install build\n\nrequirements:\n  run_exports:\n    - ${{ pin_subpackage(\"lcg-relax\", upper_bound=\"x.x.x\") }}\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - cmake\n    - ninja\n  host:\n    - root_base\n    - root_cxx_standard\n    - clhep\n    - gsl\n\ntests:\n  - package_contents:\n      lib:\n        - libCLHEPRflx\n        - libMathRflx\n        - libMathAddRflx\n        - libSTLRflx\n        - libSTLAddRflx\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://lcginfo.cern.ch/pkg/RELAX/\n  license: LGPL-2.0-or-later\n  license_file: README.md\n  summary: Reflex dictionaries for commonly used HEP libraries\n  description: |\n    RELAX provides Reflex dictionaries for commonly used libraries in the\n    LCG software stack, including CLHEP, HepMC, ROOT Math, and STL containers.\n    These dictionaries enable reflection capabilities for use with ROOT I/O\n    and other tools requiring runtime type information.\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - chrisburr\n",
